#   DslError idiom (ash_r2rml finding #4, resource.ex:493-511)
# - Info module getter/getter!/predicate? triple + legacy-conversion
#   fallback (ash_r2rml finding #5, resource.ex:514-553)
# - arbitrary N-length third-party extension composition, not just the
#   fixed ash_graphql/ash_json_api pair aex:CompositionTarget covers
